@startuml
title Lifecycle of one farm plot

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

[*] --> EMPTY
EMPTY --> PLANTED : /plant\nstore crop and duration
PLANTED --> GROWING : /water\nset readyAt
GROWING --> GROWING : /fertilize (once)\nreduce remaining time by 25%
GROWING --> READY : Clock reaches readyAt
READY --> EMPTY : /harvest\nrecord crop and reset plot

note right of GROWING
  Closing the app does not pause growth.
  readyAt is an absolute Instant.
end note

note bottom of PLANTED
  A planted crop does not grow
  until it is watered.
end note

@enduml
